pens in Settings, not terminal.\n\n## Package\n\n~~~bash\nmake package\n~~~\n\nExpected internal steps:\n~~~bash\nscripts/build_appimage.sh\nscripts/smoke_appimage.sh dist/Koffer-*.AppImage\n~~~\n\n## Clean\n\n~~~bash\nmake clean\n~~~\n\nMay remove:\n- build output;\n- test cache;\n- generated temporary artifacts.\n\nMust never remove user XDG data.\n\n## CI parity\n\nEvery CI command must be runnable locally through the same Make/script entry points. Avoid CI-only magic.\n\n## Dreadnought\n\nDreadnought command names may evolve. The required semantic operations are:\n- initialize campaign against Koffer dev;\n- seed scratch;\n- dispatch Cursor Project Arm with an Order;","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":159,"fileSize":2440,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/koffer/docs/26-command-reference.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":150},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-ed3c14c0-83e7-463b-b586-b9fa81d16eb0-10\nfc_p3vLSNk-3LYxF7-fe4704f8-aws_ue1_1","startedAtMs":"1791144831076","completedAtMs":"1791144831353"},"model_call_id":"7f08ae26-8292-49b2-9e41-cdc985231bed-2-l6s4","session_id":"b3e6f58c-23c0-4d08-ae18-617e61c16dc2","timestamp_ms":1791144831330}
