ortion of S07.\n\nDeliver:\n- paged Sample table;\n- search/FTS;\n- structured filters/sort;\n- saved searches;\n- PlaybackService;\n- waveform cache;\n- Inspector;\n- favourites/recents;\n- column persistence.\n\nGate:","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":298,"fileSize":6222,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/.dreadnought/scratch/koffer/work/docs/22-implementation-roadmap.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-151ae204-9f67-4240-9b07-1d5a7e4ada8f-17\nfc_p3vRJvU-3LYxF7-be076527-aws_ue1_2","startedAtMs":"1791145781530","completedAtMs":"1791145781777"},"model_call_id":"899a6a77-1cad-4acb-823b-3633a1af8ed3-3-ktqh","session_id":"3ac07d88-4516-42c6-b14d-0482f3a10c69","timestamp_ms":1791145781744}
