nary fixture size stays small.\n\n## Filesystem failure fixtures\n\nTests simulate:\n- read-only destination;\n- missing Source;\n- Source disappears during scan;\n- permission denied;\n- destination exists;\n- cross-filesystem move abstraction;\n- interrupted copy temp file;\n- rename failure;\n- metadata writer failure after temp creation.\n\nNo test requires the developer's personal sample collection.\n\n## Database migration fixtures","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":214,"fileSize":5780,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/.dreadnought/scratch/koffer/work/docs/20-testing-fixtures-and-quality.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-5f9c1014-c60f-4614-9b3b-c2f9c7acce63-30\nfc_p3vRLV4-3LYxF7-ac961b88-aws_ue1_1","startedAtMs":"1791145787423","completedAtMs":"1791145787657"},"model_call_id":"899a6a77-1cad-4acb-823b-3633a1af8ed3-5-g9bj","session_id":"3ac07d88-4516-42c6-b14d-0482f3a10c69","timestamp_ms":1791145787619}
